   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 123 of the laws of 1945 incorporating the volunteer\nand exempt firemen's benevolent association of Thornwood, New York, in\nrelation to the purposes of the volunteer and exempt firefighters' benevolent\nassociation of Thornwood, New York",
    "basePrintNo": "S8232",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8232-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §§1 & 3, Chap 123 of 1945",
    "lawSection": "Volunteer Firefighters' Benevolent Association",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8232\n\nSPONSOR: STEWART-COUSINS\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 123 of the laws of 1945 incorporating the volun-\nteer and exempt firemen's benevolent association of Thornwood, New York,\nin relation to the purposes of the volunteer and exempt firefighters'\nbenevolent association of Thornwood, New York\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThe purpose of this bill is to update the stated name and purpose of the\nVolunteer and Exempt Firefighters' Benevolent Association of Thornwood,\nNew York and to update the sections of New York Insurance Law that this\nsection of law references.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 of the bill amends existing law to update the name of the\nVolunteer and Exempt Firefighters' Benevolent Association of Thornwood,\nNew York in the law, and to update the corporation's stated purpose.\n\nSection 2 amends existing law to update the sections of New York Insur-\nance Law that the existing law references and to state that the corpo-\nration shall only use the taxes it collects to achieve its stated\npurposes.\n\nSection 3 is the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill provides necessary amendments to existing law to ensure that\nall language relating to the Volunteer and Exempt Firefighters' Benevo-\nlent Association of Thornwood, New York and New York Insurance Laws is\nup to date.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nThis is a new bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately and shall apply to taxes due on\npremiums received on and after January 1, 2026.\n",
